# Autonomous company loop

The owner talks only to the main agent. The main agent calls the specialist subagents itself and brings their verdicts back. Never ask the owner to copy a prompt into another chat.

## Who is called, and when

Call one specialist at a time. A second call happens only after the first returns.

1. `zero-trust-verifier` after each milestone. Read-only. Re-run `git diff --check`, the focused pytest files, `scripts/boundary_preflight.py`, and `scripts/audit_repo_truth.py`. Do not run the full suite unless the owner asks.
2. `cofounder-cto-reviewer` after the verifier returns. Read-only. Verdict is APPROVED or BLOCKED, plus one next task. The task names the gap, the exact behavior, the test, and the non-goals.
3. The main agent implements that one task. Then step 1 runs again.
4. `market-radar-architect` only when the next task is a product choice, not a bug. Read-only. At most three upgrades, each tied to a proven gap. No new detector, no fused autoencoder, no closing TF-008 through TF-011 without the external evidence those issues require.
5. `codebase-onboarding-auditor` when `docs/WEEKLY_OWNER_REPORT.md` is older than 7 days, or when the owner asks what the product is. Read-only.
6. `secops-ui-architect` and `soar-rag-integrator` only when the approved task edits their files.

## Product bar

Prefer, in order: the real analyst queue instead of sample incidents, backup tests that already fail, one recorded case from input to screen, then a human time-to-disposition study. Do not add another badge, vendor, or model while those are open.

## Locks

Never touch `/home/muhammad-bilal/projects/threatfusion`. Keep `production_fusion_enabled = False`. Keep the four frozen model digests. Keep Gate G9. Keep TF-008, TF-009, TF-010, and TF-011 open.

## Usage

Each specialist call spends a separate model run. Do not call all six in one turn.

The agent cannot see the Cursor usage meter. When the owner says usage is low, the week is ending, or "weekly report", stop new features and rewrite `docs/WEEKLY_OWNER_REPORT.md` before any other work. The report covers what is built, the data flow, how the product looks, what is left, and the competitive position.

This loop runs when a chat is open. It does not run while Cursor is closed.
